layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Sports Photography — Grosby Group Content Library"
seo_title: "Sports Photography — Grosby Group | Copa América, Football & More"
seo_description: "Complete editorial sports photography for Latin American publishers. Copa América, FIFA World Cup, Formula One, tennis, and more — licensed from AFP and the world's leading sports agencies."
permalink: /content/sports/
lang: en
faq:
  - question: "What sports are covered?"
    answer: "We cover all major sports with particular strength in football (Copa América, FIFA World Cup, CONMEBOL competitions, and top European leagues), Formula One, tennis Grand Slams, boxing, basketball, and athletics. Our partner agencies provide comprehensive coverage of both regional and global sporting events."
  - question: "How quickly is sports photography available after an event?"
    answer: "Wire agency sports photography, particularly from AFP, is typically available within minutes to hours of an event ending. Our team monitors major sporting events and can notify you when coverage arrives. Established account holders can download immediately."
  - question: "Do you cover Latin American regional competitions?"
    answer: "Yes. Copa América, CONMEBOL World Cup qualifiers, the Libertadores, South American athletics and cycling events, and other regional competitions are covered in depth. Latin American sports journalism is a core strength of our library."
  - question: "Can I get content for specific athletes or teams?"
    answer: "Our search platform allows you to find content by athlete name, team, competition, or event. Contact our team if you need help locating specific content or want to discuss a subscription that includes priority delivery for particular sports."
---

